<MECA ID = "T120021A807A865" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "20Jun2005"     MECATYPE = "GENERAL" INDSW = "OFF">
<TITLE>HDD Navigation System Operation</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><TITLE>Panel Switch Operation</TITLE>
<ITEM><PTXT>The display screens of the HDD navigation system consist of the TV mode screen, information mode screen, navigation mode screen, etc., and each mode screen can be called up using the panel switches located around the multi-display.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><TITLE>Touch Switch Operation</TITLE>
<ITEM><PTXT>After each mode screen (TV, information, etc.) is called up, operations are performed with touch switches, which allow input by directly touching the switch frames displayed on the display screen with a finger.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><TITLE>Steering Switch Operation</TITLE>
<ITEM><PTXT>TV/audio volume adjustment, etc. can be performed with the steering switches located on the steering wheel.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><TITLE>Voice Operation</TITLE>
<ITEM><PTXT>By pressing the talk switch to display the voice recognition mark on the screen and then speaking a voice command toward the voice recognition microphone, navigation and other operations can be performed, providing excellent operability.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Voice operation has a "Standard Mode" and an "Extended Mode", which can be switched as desired according to purpose.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<FIGURE>
<GRAPHIC GRAPHICNAME = "a4740063e" WIDTH = "6.903in" HEIGHT = "4.736in" />
</FIGURE>
<TABLE FRAME = "ALL" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1"><TITLE>Voice Operation Modes</TITLE>
<TGROUP COLS = "2" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1" TGROUPSTYLE = "Table_10">
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "1" COLNAME = "1" COLWIDTH = "14%"/>
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "2" COLNAME = "2" COLWIDTH = "85%"/>
<THEAD>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Mode</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Description</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
</THEAD>
<TBODY>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Standard Mode</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM>
<PTXT>Only navigation operations are possible</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Basic voice commands for navigation and G-BOOK ALPHA<HINTREF REFID = "H403120021A807A86501"/> operation can be used</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The command list is displayed by pressing the talk switch or pressing the "Help" touch switch</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "0">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Extended Mode</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM>
<PTXT>Navigation, audio and G-BOOK ALPHA<HINTREF REFID = "H403120021A807A86501"/> can be operated</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>All voice commands can be used</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The command list is displayed by touching the "Help" touch switch</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Map search is also possible by speaking a genre, telephone number, postal code, map code or memory point name</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></ENTRY>
</ROW>
</TBODY>
</TGROUP></TABLE>
<HINT>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT ID = "H403120021A807A86501">G-BOOK ALPHA voice commands are valid only when a service contract and various registrations have been completed.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></HINT></MECA>
